{"parse": {"title": "箱装同行录", "pageid": 139445, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"箱装同行录\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/ac/Item-481011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"箱装同行录\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>箱装同行录</b><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>1#481011</div></div><hr /><div>你渴望了解，抑或想要结识的同伴都在这儿，开启后可从中挑选指定的6星角色组合到访。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">几枚新相纸悄声落入此处，你熟悉那上面的模样，亦渴望与他们再度相见。翻开它，便会有新朋友循着这份邀约，来到你身边。</div><span class=\"item-infobox-subtitle\"><small class=\"serif\" style=\"white-space:nowrap; font-weight:bold; color:#555\">内含</small><hr class=\"inline\" /></span><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"source-text\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1/501020\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9B%B2%E5%A8%98%2B%E7%8E%AF%E7%8A%B6%E6%B0%B4%E6%98%9F%E7%BB%84%E5%90%88\" title=\"曲娘+环状水星组合\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%9B%B2%E5%A8%98%2B%E7%8E%AF%E7%8A%B6%E6